<title>UK: Canadian Air June cargo traffic up 9.9pct.</title>
<headline>Canadian Air June cargo traffic up 9.9pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Air Cargo said its June cargo tonne miles (CTMs) totalled 46.8 million, an increase of 9.9 percent from June 1996</p>
<p>    Month    1997	 1996	 Percent</p>
<p>    June     million CTMs  million CTMs    Change</p>
<p>    Freight  45.4	 41.3	 up  9.9</p>
<p>    Airmail   1.4	  1.3	 up  7.7</p>
<p>    Total    46.8	 42.6	 up  9.9</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
